This project is an independent arXiv radar for AI physics and scientific
machine learning papers. It is inspired by the public arXiv-daily repository
pattern in:

  Vincentqyw/cv-arxiv-daily
  https://github.com/Vincentqyw/cv-arxiv-daily
  License: Apache License 2.0

The first Physics prototype was seeded from:

  YuzeHao2023/daily-arxiv-ai4physics
  https://github.com/YuzeHao2023/daily-arxiv-ai4physics

The arxiv-radar layer adds monthly corpus shards, canonical tags, pre-rendered
tag pages, popup abstracts, archive/prune tooling, tests, and an MCP-oriented
data layout.

arXiv metadata and abstracts are obtained from arXiv public metadata services.
Do not assume paper PDFs or source archives inherit this repository's license.
